sequenceDiagram
    title Diagramme de séquence - Assistant intelligent
    participant Client as Client
    participant Frontend as Lamma IA
    participant AiController as Controleur IA
    participant AiService as Service IA
    participant Ollama as Ollama

    Client->>Frontend: Ouvrir l'assistant intelligent
    activate Frontend
    Frontend-->>Client: Afficher l'interface de chat
    Client->>Frontend: Saisir une question
    Frontend->>AiController: POST /ai/chat
    activate AiController
    AiController->>AiService: discuter(message)
    activate AiService
    AiService->>Ollama: Envoyer la requete au modele Llama
    activate Ollama

    alt reponse disponible
        Ollama-->>AiService: Reponse generee
        AiService-->>AiController: Reponse
        AiController-->>Frontend: Reponse du chatbot
        Frontend-->>Client: Afficher la reponse
    else service indisponible
        Ollama-->>AiService: Erreur ou timeout
        AiService-->>AiController: Message d'erreur
        AiController-->>Frontend: Echec de la requete
        Frontend-->>Client: Afficher un message d'erreur
    end
    deactivate Ollama
    deactivate AiService
    deactivate AiController
    deactivate Frontend
